{"task_id": "HumanEval/40", "solution": "import itertools\n\ndef triples_sum_to_zero(l: list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if there are three distinct elements in the input list that sum to zero.\n    Returns True if such a triple exists, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(l) < 3:\n        return False\n\n    for combo in itertools.combinations(l, 3):\n        if sum(combo) == 0:\n            return True\n    return False"}
